{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-06-24-021", "date": "2026-06-24", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec", "lg_elec", "boe"], "customers": ["samsung_elec", "lg_elec"], "suppliers": ["boe"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "For its new 2026 products, Apple to rely exclusively on AMOLEDs from Samsung and LG as BOE fails to enter its supply chain", "content": "<p>Towards the end of 2025 <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/boe-halted-some-its-iphone-amoled-production-its-b11-fab-december-it-suffers\">BOE suffered from disruptions at its B11 AMOLED production line</a>, which is where BOE produces smartphone AMOLED displays for Apple's iPhones. The company <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/boe-resumes-production-iphone-17-amoleds-after-it-regained-approval-apple\">later resumed production</a>, following what was one of several OLED quality issued the compa", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/its-new-2026-products-apple-rely-exclusively-amoleds-samsung-and-lg-boe-fails", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-06-24-022", "date": "2026-06-24", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung Display starts producing foldable OLEDs for Apple's first foldable iPhone", "content": "<p>According to reports from Korea, Samsung Display has started to mass produce foldable OLED panels to Apple's first foldable iPhone. SDC is producing the foldable panels in its Asan, Korea hub, while the modules are produced in its Vietnam's module factory.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2025-04/Apple-Samsung-OLED-foldable-phone-concept.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"image-style-large\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/styles/large/public/2025-0", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/samsung-display-starts-producing-foldable-oleds-apples-first-foldable-iphone", "type": "rss"}]}
